flowchart TB
    subgraph Interfaces[交互层：两个独立应用]
        Console[能力中台 8090<br/>资源配置 / Agent 编辑 / 右侧试运行]
        Futures[期货工作台 8098<br/>任务按钮 / 研究进度 / 证据结果]
    end
    subgraph Platform[平台服务：独立 Go 进程]
        Control[中台 BFF]
        Business[期货 BFF<br/>业务动作绑定 Agent 版本]
        Registry[Registry 8096<br/>提示词 / Skill / MCP / Agent / 知识配置]
        Runtime[Runtime API 8094<br/>提交 / 取消 / 约束 / 核对]
        Workers[Worker 1 ... N<br/>模型编排 / 租约 / 检查点 / Compact]
        ToolHub[ToolHub 8091<br/>工具校验 / 效果 / 回执]
        Storage[Storage 8092<br/>文档 / 记忆 / 不可变产物]
        Knowledge[Knowledge 8095<br/>上传 / 来源 / 检索]
        Indexer[Indexer 1 ... N<br/>持久化导入状态 / 分片索引]
        Sandbox[Sandbox 8093<br/>固定镜像 / 受限 JavaScript]
        Telemetry[可选事件导出]
    end
    Console --> Control
    Futures --> Business
    Control --> Registry
    Control --> Runtime
    Control --> Knowledge
    Control --> Storage
    Business --> Runtime
    Runtime --> Queue[(PostgreSQL 持久化待执行状态)]
    Queue --> Workers
    Workers --> Model[DeepSeek / 兼容模型服务]
    Workers --> ToolHub
    ToolHub --> Storage
    ToolHub --> Knowledge
    ToolHub --> Sandbox
    ToolHub --> MCP[外部 MCP Streamable HTTP]
    Knowledge --> Indexer
    Indexer --> Milvus[可选 Milvus + Embedding]
    Indexer --> Graph[可选独立 LightRAG 工作区]
    Knowledge --> Milvus
    Knowledge --> Graph
    Sandbox --> Docker[专用 Docker daemon<br/>无网络 / 只读 / 资源限制]
    Telemetry --> Langfuse[可选 Langfuse OTLP]
    subgraph Persistence[首版物理存储：同一 PostgreSQL，无独立服务数据库隔离]
        DB[(版本化资源 / runs / events / calls / model_attempts<br/>原始文件 bytea / documents / 引用 / 记忆<br/>knowledge_files / chunks / 加密凭证 / business_runs)]
    end
    Registry --- DB
    Runtime --- DB
    Workers --- DB
    ToolHub --- DB
    Storage --- DB
    Knowledge --- DB
    Indexer --- DB
    Business --- DB
    Telemetry --- DB
